    "detailed_description": "<strong>Secrets of Godhelm: Riverfall</strong> is a brand new Fantasy RPG where you must explore a world full of monsters, magic, and myth to save it from annihilation.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/818630/extras/733ae3300ba3565c264272ad52ac107f.poster.avif?t=1619123532\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/818630/extras/733ae3300ba3565c264272ad52ac107f.webm?t=1619123532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/818630/extras/733ae3300ba3565c264272ad52ac107f.mp4?t=1619123532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>You are an adventurer with great potential for natural magic. It's up to you if you want to cultivate your magical abilities, or practice the more traditional arts of physical combat. Either way, you will need to defend yourself against more than just the ruthless wilds of <strong>Riverfall</strong>.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/818630/extras/3752305f36864a419112264b7bb47cbc.poster.avif?t=1619123532\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/818630/extras/3752305f36864a419112264b7bb47cbc.webm?t=1619123532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/818630/extras/3752305f36864a419112264b7bb47cbc.mp4?t=1619123532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>It has been over a thousand years since the last calamity brought down by the fury and chaos of the god <strong>Baru the Wild</strong>.  He laid siege to the planet Godhelm seeking to destroy the alliance of Humans, Dryma, Groves, and Humarans in the country Riverfall - but his army of Scourge was defeated.  Today, the old alliances are frail and nearly forgotten, and <strong>Baru the Wild</strong> is looking to finish what was started all those years ago. Choose one of these four playable races, and finesse your desired combat style to mount a resistance against his relentless armies once more.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/818630/extras/6845429822c6ad2892fce664723f4565.avif?t=1619123532\" /></div><br><br>Explore the vast, mysterious, and wonderful countryside to uncover the long lost secrets of this land. From <i>The Red Desert</i>, to <i>The Shield</i>. From <i>The Wandering Mountains</i>, to <i>The Everdorn Grasslands</i>.  Mystery awaits in this country that is equally serene as it is deadly. You must find a way to unite Riverfall against <strong>Baru the Wild</strong> and cast him back into the stars, or else risk losing everything.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/818630/extras/78144f8d80d92fc5f9755db2c26ce64c.poster.avif?t=1619123532\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/818630/extras/78144f8d80d92fc5f9755db2c26ce64c.webm?t=1619123532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/818630/extras/78144f8d80d92fc5f9755db2c26ce64c.mp4?t=1619123532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Secrets of Godhelm: Riverfall</strong> is a brand new Fantasy RPG where you must explore a world full of monsters, magic, and myth to save it from annihilation.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/818630/extras/733ae3300ba3565c264272ad52ac107f.poster.avif?t=1619123532\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/818630/extras/733ae3300ba3565c264272ad52ac107f.webm?t=1619123532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/818630/extras/733ae3300ba3565c264272ad52ac107f.mp4?t=1619123532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>You are an adventurer with great potential for natural magic. It's up to you if you want to cultivate your magical abilities, or practice the more traditional arts of physical combat. Either way, you will need to defend yourself against more than just the ruthless wilds of <strong>Riverfall</strong>.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/818630/extras/3752305f36864a419112264b7bb47cbc.poster.avif?t=1619123532\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/818630/extras/3752305f36864a419112264b7bb47cbc.webm?t=1619123532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/818630/extras/3752305f36864a419112264b7bb47cbc.mp4?t=1619123532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>It has been over a thousand years since the last calamity brought down by the fury and chaos of the god <strong>Baru the Wild</strong>.  He laid siege to the planet Godhelm seeking to destroy the alliance of Humans, Dryma, Groves, and Humarans in the country Riverfall - but his army of Scourge was defeated.  Today, the old alliances are frail and nearly forgotten, and <strong>Baru the Wild</strong> is looking to finish what was started all those years ago. Choose one of these four playable races, and finesse your desired combat style to mount a resistance against his relentless armies once more.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/818630/extras/6845429822c6ad2892fce664723f4565.avif?t=1619123532\" /></div><br><br>Explore the vast, mysterious, and wonderful countryside to uncover the long lost secrets of this land. From <i>The Red Desert</i>, to <i>The Shield</i>. From <i>The Wandering Mountains</i>, to <i>The Everdorn Grasslands</i>.  Mystery awaits in this country that is equally serene as it is deadly. You must find a way to unite Riverfall against <strong>Baru the Wild</strong> and cast him back into the stars, or else risk losing everything.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/818630/extras/78144f8d80d92fc5f9755db2c26ce64c.poster.avif?t=1619123532\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/818630/extras/78144f8d80d92fc5f9755db2c26ce64c.webm?t=1619123532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/818630/extras/78144f8d80d92fc5f9755db2c26ce64c.mp4?t=1619123532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
